#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:44
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked K3b will create a playlist of the ripped files\n"
"which can be used with programs like xmms or noatun.\n"
"<p>You may use the special strings to give the playlist a unique filename."
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn disse Optschoon utsöcht is, stellt K3b en Afspeellist mit de utleesten\n"
"Dateien op, wat Programmen as \"xmms\" oder \"noatun\" bruken köönt.\n"
"<p>För en eensoortet Naam vun de Afspeellist laat sik de \"Besünneren Tekenkeden\" bruken."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui line 92
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:49
msgid "&Use relative paths"
msgstr "&Relative Padden bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui line 95
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:52
msgid "Use relative paths instead of absolute"
msgstr "Relative Padden staats afsolute bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui line 101
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:55
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, the entries in the playlist will be relative to its location.\n"
"<p>Example: If your playlist is located in <em>/home/myself/music</em> and\n"
"your audio files are in <em>/home/myself/music/cool</em>; then the entries in the\n"
"playlist will look something like: <em>cool/track1.ogg</em>."
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn disse Optschoon anmaakt is, warrt de Indrääg relativ to den Oort vun de Afspeellist opstellt.\n"
"<p>Bispill: Wenn Dien Afspeellist in <em>/home/iksülven/musik</em> un\n"
"Dien Klangdateien in <em>/home/iksülven/musik/deegt</em> liggt, denn\n"
"süht en Indrag in de Afspeellist t.B. so ut:<em>deegt/track1.ogg</em>."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui line 110
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:61
msgid "Create si&ngle file"
msgstr "E&nkel Datei opstellen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui line 113
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:64
msgid "Rip all tracks to a single file"
msgstr "All Dateien na en enkelte Datei utlesen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui line 120
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:67
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked K3b will create only one\n"
"audio file no matter how many tracks are ripped. This\n"
"file will contain all tracks one after the other.\n"
"<p>This might be useful to rip a live album or a radio play.\n"
"<p><b>Caution:</b> The file will have the name of the first track."
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn disse Optschoon anmaakt is, stellt K3b bloots\n"
"en Klangdatei op, liek wo vele Stücken utleest warrt.\n"
"Disse Datei bargt denn all Stücken naenanner.\n"
"<p>Dit kann för't Utlesen vun Live-Alben oder Radioprogrammen goot wesen.\n"
"<p><b>Wohrschoen:</b> De Datei heet denn as de eerste Titel."

